+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,4 +1,7 @@
 # Profile package
 
 `primary_tag` displays the first user-supplied nonblank tag. Export access
 requires all listed roles. The label and audit helpers format display text.
+
+The package accepts plain strings and sets. Display-only helpers do not
+perform authorization checks; callers must use `can_export` before an export.
